{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:ced24cd83f39b2ee","name":"Knighthunter","source":{"id":"source:reference-ced24cd83f39b2ee","title":"Knighthunter","revision":20229,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:26:59Z","sha256":"fe87b5a6b8bc798bfd40618788f00e43a958b36c6591a4dca9d6bb098bb4b926","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20229","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Knighthunter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-ced24cd83f39b2ee","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A new breed of Stormtroopers in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"},", Knighthunters are a special division of the Imperial Army that operates directly under the command of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Sith"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Sith","referenceId":"reference:32bde5e69837ac8e"},". Formally known within the army command structure as the 1,001st Stormtrooper division, the Knighthunters specialize in hunting down, capturing and killing the remaining Jedi in the galaxy. Like other elite Stormtrooper groups, the Knighthunters receive training and equipment that is far beyond that of normal soldiers. When a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lord","referenceId":"reference:099f599e53fbfc32"}," gets word of a Jedi on the run, he or she will often bring a detachment of Knighthunters on the mission to ensure that the Jedi does not escape, or worse get the drop on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lord"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lord","referenceId":"reference:099f599e53fbfc32"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Knighthunters focus their efforts on neutralizing ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," by any means possible. They carry special Phrik-laced ",{"tag":"a","children":["Electrostaffs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Electrostaffs"}," which have the ability to stand up to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attacks and give the Knighthunters the ability to fight in melee combat with Jedi. Since ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," can deflect normal blaster shots, the Knighthunters use special ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sonic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sonic"}," weapons when they must resort to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:3c89b302f9fd687b"}," (though most Knighthunter strategies involve converging on a Jedi and swarming them with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attacks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attacks","referenceId":"reference:dbacc8ccae71d4dc"},"). ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knighthunter Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knighthunter_Armor","referenceId":"reference:30c6414b57131b8f"}," is based on the armor of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Coruscant Guard"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Coruscant_Guard"},", though the armor is jet black.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Knighthunters train under grueling conditions to learn how to defend against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"}," attacks, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Powers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Powers","referenceId":"reference:85acec94cd1ca5f3"},", and enemies capable of incredible feats of acrobatics and athleticism. Moreover much of this training comes at the hands of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sith Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Lords"}," themselves who teach the Knighthunters how to fight against ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},"-wielding foes. As with all Sith training routines, the fatality rate among Knighthunters in training is far higher than among all other troopers.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Knighthunter Statistics (CL 7)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 7/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 2; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +14; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +14\n"]},{"tag":"p"